OL,3,GNEWSASports clubs 'devastated' by
OL,4,Aoff-road riding damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FSport clubs have described the
OL,7,F"devastating impact" of off-road riding
OL,8,Fwhich they say risks player safety and
OL,9,Fchurns up playing fields.
OL,11,FA rugby club in Kent said team members
OL,12,Fhad suffered ankle injuries from damage
OL,13,Fto the surface caused by riders using
OL,14,Fvehicles to plough up pitches.
OL,16,FWhile a Sussex cricket team described
OL,17,Fhow its wickets, along with another
OL,18,Fclub's nearby, were deliberately
OL,19,Fdamaged over the winter.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
