OL,3,GNEWSASports clubs 'devastated' by
OL,4,Aoff-road riding damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says police will be able
OL,7,Fto more easily seize and destroy
OL,8,Fvehicles used for anti social behaviour
OL,9,Funder new powers introduced in July.
